{"path":"container/forward_list/prepend_range","title":"std::forward_list<T,Allocator>::prepend_range","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::forward_list&lt;T,Allocator&gt;::</span>prepend_range","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/forward_list/prepend_range","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Inserts, in non-reversing order, copies of elements in rg before begin(). Each iterator in the range rg is dereferenced exactly once.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/to\"><span class=\"kw100\">container-compatible-range</span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> R <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> prepend_range<span class=\"br0\">(</span> R<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> rg <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Inserts, in non-reversing order, copies of elements in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code> before <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/forward_list/begin\"><code>begin()</code></a>. Each iterator in the range <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code> is dereferenced exactly once.\n</p><p>No iterators or references are invalidated.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> rg\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/to#container_compatible_range\">container compatible range</a>, that is, an <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/input_range\"><code>input_range</code></a> whose elements are convertible to <code>T</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par-hitem\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"> Type requirements\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par-req\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"> -<div class=\"spacer\"></div><code>T</code> must be <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/EmplaceConstructible\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">EmplaceConstructible</em></a> into <code>forward_list</code> from <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/begin\"><span class=\"kw2900\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">begin</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.  Otherwise, the behavior is undefined.\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Linear in size of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable ftm-begin ftm-has-value\">\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/feature_test\">Feature-test</a> macro</th>\n<th><abbr>Value</abbr></th>\n<th><abbr>Std</abbr></th>\n<th>Feature\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/feature_test#cpp_lib_containers_ranges\"><code>__cpp_lib_containers_ranges</code></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/compiler_support/23#cpp_lib_containers_ranges_202202L\"><code>202202L</code></a></td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark\">(C++23)</span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/to#container_compatible_range\">Ranges-aware</a> construction and insertion\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;algorithm&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;forward_list&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;vector&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> container <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/forward_list\"><span class=\"kw1281\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward_list</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> rg <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector\"><span class=\"kw1277\">std::<span class=\"me2\">vector</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"co2\">#if __cpp_lib_containers_ranges</span>\n    container.<span class=\"me1\">prepend_range</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#else</span>\n    container.<span class=\"me1\">insert_after</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>container.<span class=\"me1\">before_begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, rg.<span class=\"me1\">cbegin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, rg.<span class=\"me1\">cend</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#endif</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/ranges/equal\"><span class=\"kw2998\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">equal</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>container, <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/forward_list\"><span class=\"kw1281\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward_list</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">0</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>insert_range</span></span></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  inserts a range of elements <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/forward_list/insert_range_after\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>insert_range_after</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  inserts a range of elements after an element <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/forward_list/push_front\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>push_front</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  inserts an element to the beginning <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/forward_list/emplace_front\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>emplace_front</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs an element in-place at the beginning <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/forward_list","title":"std::forward_list"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::forward_list<T,Allocator>::prepend_range","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Inserts, in non-reversing order, copies of elements in rg before begin()."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"rg"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Linear in size of rg."},{"label":"Notes"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"insert_range","note":"inserts a range of elements"},{"label":"insert_range_after","note":"inserts a range of elements after an element"},{"label":"push_front","note":"inserts an element to the beginning"},{"label":"emplace_front","note":"constructs an element in-place at the beginning"}]}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":178,"codeBlockCount":1}
